  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Looking for a possible toggle or setting options so that if you pick up an item in world with the knuckles controllers, you are able to lock the item to hand instead of having to hold constant pressure on the handle. \n\nHaving to squeeze for a long time fatigues your hand after a while. Plus it hard to keep a constant hold on items. \n\nYou are able to do this with vive wands so it makes picking up game items or things like glow sticks easy to hold on to while still having gesture controls. \n\nMaybe make it a double squeeze on the handle or make it an option that on trigger pull it locks to your hand as instead and squeezing the handle releases it?",
